  - Student loan interest deduction claimed ≈ $2,500 (max).
  - These adjustments reduce your AGI and taxable income. (These are illustrative; exact computation on your return will differ slightly.)
- If the $780 is NOT related to consulting (i.e., unreimbursed employee expenses for W‑2 job), they are not deductible.

Questions / items I need you to confirm
1. Are the $8,900 consulting earnings reported to you on a 1099‑NEC or other 1099? (Even if not, you still must report it.)
