- Net earnings subject to SE tax = 92.35% × net SE income ≈ 0.9235 × $4,391.36 ≈ $4,054.6
- SE tax ≈ 15.3% × $4,054.6 ≈ $620.2 (reported on Schedule SE)
- Deduction for half of SE tax (adjustment on Schedule 1) ≈ $310.1

