- File Oregon resident return (OR‑40) and include your wages, interest, and net self-employment income. Oregon allows certain differences from federal — you’ll follow OR instructions. Keep state tax paid records if you itemize for state purposes (but remember the federal SALT cap if you itemize at the federal level).

