Summary of what you can deduct, how to treat the home office, whether to itemize, and which forms you’ll need (federal + Oregon):

1) Income you must report
- W-2 wages: $64,800 (Desert Sun Logistics) — report on Form 1040 using the W-2.
- Self‑employment (consulting): $8,900 — report on Schedule C (Profit or Loss From Business). If you received 1099‑NEC/1099‑MISC from clients, include them; even if you didn’t receive 1099s you must still report the income.
