- If those expenses are actually business expenses related to your self‑employment (consulting), you can deduct them on Schedule C.

5) Student loan interest ($2,700 paid)
- The student loan interest deduction is an above‑the‑line adjustment on Form 1040 (reported on Schedule 1) up to $2,500 for 2023. You stated $2,700 paid — the maximum deductible amount is $2,500.
