Assistant: Summary (quick answer)
- For federal 2023 you will almost certainly take the standard deduction ($27,700 for Married Filing Jointly) rather than itemizing, unless you have large additional itemizable items (big state taxes, mortgage interest, large medical expenses).
- Your consulting income should be reported on Schedule C (self‑employment) if it’s from independent contracting; business expenses (including quali

  Chunk 3/14 (512 chars):
