- You appear eligible (exclusive, regular business use, self‑employed consulting).
- Two methods:
  1) Simplified method: $5.00 × 165 sq ft = $825 deduction (no depreciation or allocation paperwork). Simple and usually best when home-office share of rent would otherwise exceed your net business income.
