- You’ll file Oregon resident return (OR‑40) for 2023. Oregon starts with federal AGI and then applies state modifications. Some federal suspensions (e.g., certain employee expense rules) may be different for Oregon — consult Oregon instructions or a state specialist. Oregon generally taxes interest and self‑employment income like federal, and you’ll also pay Oregon income tax on your total income. Portland has no local income tax to my knowledge.

